` the tab key, which opens info mode. the one on the sheet has letters too small and too smudged to
` read, so this is a picture of its own, 32 by 20. Tools are not needed to make it again: the pixels
` are plain, and any paint program will do.
global TEX_KEY_TAB
global TEX_PAD `the same thing for the buttons of a controller.

