` setup_input, in fish_routines_input, binds the keys and the controller buttons to them.
global ACT_LEFT
global ACT_RIGHT
global ACT_UP
global ACT_DOWN
global ACT_SWAP `held with a direction to swap fish
global ACT_CONFIRM `picks the highlighted thing on a menu
global ACT_INFO
global ACT_PAUSE

` a move ability is held with a direction, the same way that the swap is. on a controller they are
