` menu. menu_transition does both. it wipes the upgrade screen when TRANSITION_FOR_UPGRADE is set.
` the setup is in fish_routines_upgrade.
global TARGET_UPGRADE
global UPGRADE_COMPOSITE_SPRITE `draws the upgrade screen over the game, through the mask that the bubbles paint
global UPGRADE_DIM_SPRITE `the dark backdrop of the upgrade screen, which the game shows through
global UPGRADE_INVERT = 0 `1 while the bubbles are taking the upgrade screen away, instead of bringing it in
global TRANSITION_FOR_UPGRADE = 0 `1 when menu_transition is wiping the upgrade screen, and not the menu

` the upgrade screen does not have to be taken up on its offer. underneath the cards there is a line that
` takes none of them. down goes to it, and up, left and right go back to the cards.
global UPGRADE_SKIP_TEXT_ID
global UPGRADE_SKIP_SELECTED = 0 `1 while the line that takes nothing is the one that is highlighted
global UPGRADE_SKIP_Y = 268

