` the moves. MOVE_ABILITY_BINDINGS(n) is the move in slot n, which is the move on button n. a slot
` can be empty, so check `assigned`. MOVE_ABILITY_COUNT is how many of the slots have a move in them.
global MOVE_ABILITY_BINDINGS_LENGTH = 10
