global SAVE_PREF_PASSIVES = 300 `the passives, in order
global SAVE_PREF_MOVES = 350 `the move in every slot, with two numbers each
global SAVE_PREF_CELLS = 1000 `one number for every cell of the board
global SAVE_SIGNATURE = -1 `what saveSignature said at the last save. the game is saved again when that changes.

` THE HIGH SCORES. the routines are in fish_routines_highscores, and the top of that file explains how they work.
` there is a table for every kind of game: every length, in both modes. a table is a run of HISCORE_ROWS
