global HINT_FADE_MS# = 160 `how long one takes to fade all the way in, or out, in milliseconds
global HINT_FADE_LAST_MS = 0
global HINT_GAME_ON = 1 `1 while the hints are the three of the game, and 0 while some other screen has written its own

` in the very first game, info mode opens by itself, and the only hint is the one to close it again.
