` THE LOG OF UPGRADES. every upgrade that gets picked is written down, with the move that it was picked on.
` each one is one number: the move, times 100, plus the card. logUpgrade, in fish_routines_highscores, adds one.
` the log of the game that is being played is saved with the game. when a game gets onto a table, its log
` goes with it, and picking its row on the table shows it.
global HISCORE_LOG_MAX = 100 `the most upgrades that get written down for one game
